Value Filldown SNOOPING_STATE (enabled|disabled)
Value Filldown OPTION82_STATE (enabled|disabled)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value TRUSTED (yes|no)
Value RATE_LIMIT_PPS (\S+)
Value ALLOW_OPTION (yes|no)

Start
  ^Switch\s+DHCP\s+snooping\s+is\s+${SNOOPING_STATE}\s*$$
  ^Insertion\s+of\s+option\s+82\s+is\s+${OPTION82_STATE}\s*$$
  ^\s*Interface\s+Trusted\s+Allow\s+option\s+Rate\s+limit\s+\(pps\)\s*$$ -> TableWithOption
  ^\s*Interface\s+Trusted\s+Rate\s+limit\s+\(pps\)\s*$$ -> Table
  ^.*$$

Table
  ^\s*-+\s+-+\s+-+\s*$$
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${TRUSTED}\s+${RATE_LIMIT_PPS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^.*$$

TableWithOption
  ^\s*-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s*$$
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${TRUSTED}\s+${ALLOW_OPTION}\s+${RATE_LIMIT_PPS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^.*$$
